{
  "journey": "The 0 block takes no lines, and a vertical line on this 2 would run into it, so this 2 must be horizontal.",
  "overConnected": "The 0 block takes no lines, and a vertical line on this 2 would run into it, so this 2 must be horizontal.",
  "starved": "The 1 block has one open side, and a vertical line on this square would close it, so this square must be horizontal.",
  "tooLong": "A horizontal line on this square would run the 1's line to 2 squares, too long for it, so this square must be vertical.",
  "twoClues": "A vertical line on this 2 would join the 1 and the 2 along the outlined squares, so this 2 must be horizontal.",
  "unreachable": "The 4 needs more room, and a horizontal line on this 4 would leave it 1 square, so this 4 must be vertical.",
}
`;
